      "id": 1,
      "text": "Elk Creek first appeared in the late 1860s as a trading hub, opening a post office in 1872 and serving as a stagecoach stop between Colusa and Newville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
